<title>CANADA: Canada's Prairies to see rain west, sun east.</title>
<headline>Canada's Prairies to see rain west, sun east.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canada's Prairies on Monday were forecast to see rain in the west and sun in the east, Environment Canada said.</p>
<p>Alberta should see showers in the north and central regions with highs of 18 to 27 Celsius.</p>
<p>Saskatchewan should see a chance of showers and highs of 15 to 25 Celsius.</p>
<p>Manitoba should see sunny skies with highs of 10 to 15 Celsius.</p>
<p>((Gilbert Le Gras 204 947 3548))</p>
